CharmedBaryon tree skymp pins. The reader follows the layout an MIT fork of the
same base implemented (github.com/Zzyxz/CommonLibSSE-NG, commits 352ba75c and
73041d57, 2026-08-22): u32 format, u32 version[4], char name[64], u32 pointer
size, u32 data format, u32 count, then one u32 RVA per ID with index = ID and
0 = absent; to be confirmed against the versionlibdb.h in the library download.
before merge. thuum branch skyrim-1.7, docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-018.

